1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,921
A customer wants a perfect night under the
stars.

2
00:00:04,001 --> 00:00:09,850
The harder problem is deciding when an
autonomous agent is allowed to spend.

3
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:14,544
ASTERION converts intent into a spending
mandate.

4
00:00:14,624 --> 00:00:21,529
In this public simulation, supplier agents
negotiate a fourteen-eighty bundle

5
00:00:21,609 --> 00:00:25,017
within a fifteen-hundred-euro ceiling.

6
00:00:25,097 --> 00:00:29,850
The backend validates the price and every
allocation.

7
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:38,253
The customer approves the exact agreement,
weather thresholds and cancellation terms.

8
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:41,764
A language model may propose a deal.

9
00:00:41,844 --> 00:00:47,850
It cannot increase the approved budget or
access payment tools.

10
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:50,962
Arm the mandate once.

11
00:00:51,042 --> 00:00:59,211
The server schedules the job, evaluates
evidence and executes

12
00:00:59,291 --> 00:01:03,308
without another payment click.

13
00:01:03,388 --> 00:01:06,602
Here the fixture passes.

14
00:01:06,682 --> 00:01:14,850
Capture and supplier distribution complete
as separate steps.

15
00:01:15,150 --> 00:01:20,897
A second agreement faces cloudy
conditions.

16
00:01:20,977 --> 00:01:28,863
The same policy blocks capture and voids
the authorization.

17
00:01:28,943 --> 00:01:32,552
This is a separate mission.

18
00:01:32,632 --> 00:01:39,850
Knowing when to refuse payment is part of
the product.

19
00:01:40,150 --> 00:01:44,874
These next results are recorded private
provider evidence.

20
00:01:44,954 --> 00:01:50,086
Three actual Gemini requests produced a
sixteen-fifty agreement

21
00:01:50,166 --> 00:01:52,690
within seventeen hundred euros.

22
00:01:52,770 --> 00:01:57,902
That same agreement completed autonomous
PayPal Sandbox capture

23
00:01:57,982 --> 00:02:03,358
and three individually checked supplier
Payouts: four twenty-five,

24
00:02:03,438 --> 00:02:06,044
six twenty and four twenty-five.

25
00:02:06,124 --> 00:02:07,834
Test funds were used.

26
00:02:07,914 --> 00:02:11,743
Inventory and settlement weather were
fixtures.

27
00:02:11,823 --> 00:02:17,850
The public records preserve the agreement
link and transaction references.

28
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:22,877
The receipt can be checked offline for
internal consistency.

29
00:02:22,957 --> 00:02:27,132
A real MET Norway forecast is available
for planning,

30
00:02:27,212 --> 00:02:29,733
with timestamps and attribution.

31
00:02:29,813 --> 00:02:31,940
It cannot unlock a payment.

32
00:02:32,020 --> 00:02:37,850
Local observations and actual operators
are the next validation milestone.

33
00:02:38,150 --> 00:02:41,269
Agents negotiate. Evidence unlocks
payment.

34
00:02:41,349 --> 00:02:43,597
La Palma is the first use case.

35
00:02:43,677 --> 00:02:47,159
ASTERION is infrastructure for complex
purchases

36
00:02:47,239 --> 00:02:49,850
under one customer-approved mandate.
